{
  "components": [
    {
      "text": "# Booking approval\n**Booking:** {{bookingRef}}  \n**Your role:** {{approver}} (approval {{approvalStep}} of {{approvalSteps}})\n\n- **Requester:** {{requesterName}} ({{email}})\n- **Attendees:** {{attendees}}\n- **Purpose:** {{purpose}}\n\n**Sessions**\n\n{{#loop sessions}}\n- {{venue}}, {{bookingDate}}, {{startTime}} to {{endTime}}\n{{/loop}}\n\nThe slots are on hold. A reminder is sent after 1 minute; after 2 minutes the request expires and the slots are released.",
      "type": "text",
      "id": "Text_Summary",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Summary",
        "columns": null
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "Approve this booking",
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "Field_Approved",
      "key": "approved",
      "defaultValue": false,
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Decision",
        "columns": null
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "Remarks",
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "Field_Remarks",
      "key": "remarks",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Remarks",
        "columns": null
      },
      "defaultValue": ""
    }
  ],
  "type": "default",
  "id": "approval-form",
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
  "executionPlatformVersion": "8.8.0",
  "exporter": {
    "name": "Camunda Modeler",
    "version": "5.49.0"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 19
}
